Package: amogos-update
Version: 2.1.0-1
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: AmogOS
Depends: dash, coreutils, dpkg, python3, python3-apt, amogos-system (>= 2.1.0-1), amogos-store (>= 0.1.4), qtwayland5, qt6-wayland, xwayland, xauth, libxcb-cursor0
Description: Versioned AmogOS system update migrations
 Runs the packaged AmogOS migration script when a newer package version
 is configured by APT or dpkg. Release 2.1 repairs desktop application
 compatibility, repository defaults and installed-system identity.
